# ============================================================================
# FZDMGNSS.PCF
# ============================================================================
#
# Description:  Final-like (1-day arcs) GNSS solution in
# Zero-Difference-Mode (ZDM)
#
# Comments   :  PCF mainly based on legacy clock processing PCFs
# (e.g., FCLKGNSS)
#
# Variables  :
#
# Flags (MSC):
#
# Author     :  E. Calero
# Created    :  20-Apr-2021
#
# Changes    :
#
# ============================================================================
#
#

PID  SCRIPT    OPT_DIR   PARAMETERS
#
# Copy observations and a priori information
# ------------------------------------------
001  JUMP_CP1            NO_OPT    CPU=LOCAL; NEXTJOB=006
002  REP_COP             FZDM_0    CPU=LOCAL; WAIT=001; PARAM1=V_K; PARAM2=V_Z; PARAM3=V_I
